      "text": "The second volume of the Grundgesetze was published before Frege received Russell's letter.",
      "label": "p6",
      "factual": true,
      "role": "claim",
      "pos": 6,
      "factual_note": "exhaustive_pair: exactly one of this pair is false"
    },
    {
