      "text": "Frege added an appendix to the second volume of the Grundgesetze proposing a revision of Basic Law V.",
      "label": "p7",
      "factual": true,
      "role": "claim",
      "pos": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "a7",
      "text": "Frege's revised version of Basic Law V was later shown to be inconsistent.",
      "label": "p8",
      "factual": true,
      "role": "claim",
      "pos": 8
    },
